silm:instances_papers_18_presheaf_semantics_04_shared_diagram_concrete_anchor_1_Mittens#mittensvetrecordpresheafanchornode1 silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensVetRecordPresheafAnchorNode1 is the published individual cat named Mittens as the canonical colimit-apex anchor for paper 18. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
